{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfs6drdtqgH25jnBKDbAR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"`find_all_matching_from_provider()` now takes an `AgeFallback` enum (`ALL`, `NEWEST`, `NONE`) in place of the boolean, and exact-version pins skip age filtering. `tests/test_cooldown.py` and `tests/test_bootstrap_requirement_resolver.py` pass (63 tests). I also ran `tests/test_resolver.py` and `tests/test_bootstrapper.py` with them, and all 143 pass.\n\nI couldn't run `ruff` or `mypy`, because neither is installed in `.venv`. I fixed import order in the test files by hand, so run `hatch run lint:fix` and `hatch run mypy:check` before committing.\n\n**Changes in `src/fromager/resolver.py`:**\n- **Fallback:** the parameter is `age_fallback`, defaulting to `AgeFallback.ALL`, with the three log messages exactly as you specified. `NEWEST` keeps only the first candidate, since candidates come back sorted highest version first.\n- **Pins:** a new helper `_is_pinned()` checks whether the constraint is a single `==` specifier. When it is, the function logs the INFO message and skips filtering, so no fallback fires. Range constraints are still filtered. A wildcard pin like `==1.2.*` also counts as a pin, since its operator is `==`.\n- **Docstrings:** the function docstring and the new enum are updated.\n\nIn `src/fromager/bootstrap_requirement_resolver.py`, multi-version mode passes `NEWEST` and single-version mode passes `ALL`.\n\n**Tests:**\n- **`tests/test_cooldown.py`:** I renamed and updated the existing \"fallback disabled\" test to use `AgeFallback.NONE`. New tests cover `NEWEST`, a pinned constraint under all three fallbacks, and a range constraint still being filtered.\n- **`tests/test_bootstrap_requirement_resolver.py`:** a parametrized test checks that multi-version mode passes `NEWEST` and single-version mode passes `ALL`.\n\nI didn't add a `versionchanged` note or touch `docs/concepts/resolver-architecture.rst`. I haven't committed anything."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":4051,"cache_read_input_tokens":61986,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":4051},"output_tokens":743,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"db78a544-0769-4fb4-bc20-c0941d2866d0","uuid":"18a0734e-a073-4eb4-a7b3-e3465886cc73","timestamp":"2026-10-09T17:59:08.256Z","request_id":"req_011Cfs6drPkeMPF5tQ5RpFhW"}
